      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly difficult to feel this lack of fulfillment even when external circumstances appear perfect. This kind of emotional emptiness, sometimes called anhedonia, can be very draining and confusing. Since this feeling is persistent and affecting your sense of daily life, please consider reaching out to a mental health professional for support. They can provide tools and insight to help you navigate this fog.",
      "source": "target",
